    "summary": "Super Micro Computer's common stock (SMCI) continues to trade actively on the Nasdaq Global Select Market. Its FY2026 Form 10-K (period ended June 30, 2026) explicitly states the registrant's name, that its common stock is listed on Nasdaq under symbol SMCI, and reports market data through fiscal 2026; a January 27, 2026 report separately confirms Nasdaq regained full compliance after resolving its prior filing-delinquency non-compliance issue, closing the earlier delisting threat. No delisting, suspension, or renaming has occurred.",
